    lignes.join('\n'),
    "",
    "Rules: never repeat a recipe; vary dish types and proteins; reuse ingredients across meals to save money; longer recipes on evenings/weekend; cout_estime is the cost in euros of that meal for " + o.personnes + " people (one serving each).",
